  "description": "Database-backed IConfiguration provider with pluggable IConfigStore abstraction, polling-based hot reload, hierarchical (AppName × Environment × Tenant × Key) scoping, per-entry IsSecret encryption via IConfigEncryptor, and an audit log. Persists no DB-engine dependency — install a provider package (SqlServer / PostgreSql) to ship.",
